ave asked ...</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"remain\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"remained\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"remained\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">It has remained ...</span>\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" instruction_table_background intro_table_border\"}", "type": "table"}, {"content": "The Taj Mahal has remained a landmark of love and devotion for many generations.", "type": "example"}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"content": "Questions With How + Adjectives", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "You use <span class=\"italic\">How</span> + <span class=\"italic\">adjective</span> in a question if you want to know how someone or something is.", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "How romantic would it be to have a building dedicated to you? ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "How beautiful should it be? ", "type": "example"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "to dedicate ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to devote time and effort to a task or someone ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: How romantic would it be to have a building dedicated to you?", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn6le15ob07aud01", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"content": "These are words you use in a conversation about the Taj Mahal.", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "calligraphy ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "decorative handwriting and lettering ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: The walls of the Taj Mahal are decorated with beautiful calligraphy. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn6le15ob07aud02", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "gateway ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "an opening t