mselves ever since the Taj Mahal was built. <br><br>\nShah Jahan, who was an emperor in India, loved his wife Mumtaz Mahal so much that after her death he decided to build a monument in her memory. It would be as beautiful as she was.", "id": 1, "time": "100", "image": "engenn6le15ob07re2img01.jpg"}, {"text": "It took 22 years to complete this stunning piece of architecture. <br>\nThe Taj Mahal has a main gateway, a large garden, a mosque, a guest house, and several other buildings. The garden is divided into four sections by four shallow pools, and each of the four sections is also divided into perfect geometrical order.", "id": 2, "time": "23100", "image": "engenn6le15ob07re2img02.jpg"}, {"text": "The interior and exterior designs include flowers and calligraphy made of gemstones. The mausoleum houses the two graves of the loving couple. It has remained a landmark of love and devotion for many generations.", "id": 3, "time": "46000", "image": "engenn6le15ob07re2img03.jpg"}], "audiosrc": "engenn6le15ob07re2aud01", "coverimg": "engenn6le15ob07re2img01.jpg"}, "type": "slideshow"}], "_data": [], "type": "audio", "template_override": 1}]}]}